{
  "rule_id": "core.eval",
  "version": "0.3.1",
  "description": "TCB 宪法 - 完整 ReAct 循环支持（v0.3.1 修复同轮重复 push；顺序语义，token 聚合优化由 governance 层负责）",
  "metadata": {
    "author": "evorule-core",
    "license": "CC0-1.0 Universal (Public Domain)",
    "public_domain_notice": "本文件(core_eval.json,即 EvoRule 宪法)以 CC0 1.0 公共领域奉献。任何人都可以自由使用、修改、再分发,无需保留版权声明。EvoRule 代码本身采用 AGPL-3.0-or-later,但本解释器规范是公共领域 —— 任何人都可以实现兼容的 EvoRule 引擎。",
    "spdx_license_id": "CC0-1.0",
    "sections": [
      "1. 原子计算指令: increment, decrement, set",
      "2. 控制流指令: sequence, conditional, while_loop",
      "3. ReAct 循环: call_external → tool_calls → collect → call_service → merge → 循环",
      "4. 默认处理: all([]) 兜底规则"
    ],
    "constraints": [
      "每条 transform 规则中最多包含一个 io_request 元指令",
      "原因: __io_results__ 是按 io_type 隔离的字段，多个 io_request 会冲突",
      "io_request 必须是 branch 的叶子节点（on_false 分支），之前不能有 set/push 操作",
      "v0.3.0 新增: has_fields 域类型、collect 元指令、merge 元指令",
      "v0.3.1 修复: 移除独立 react_iteration 规则（与 call_external 同轮执行导致重复 push），循环改由 call_service 分支内的 merge 驱动",
      "设计决策: fork-join 批处理聚合（counter_attr/push_domain/tools_remaining/原位写回）已整体移除——批处理策略违反 TCB 最小顺序语义，多工具的 token 聚合优化改由 governance 层负责",
      "ReAct 循环最大迭代次数: 10（call_service 消费结果时检查 react_iteration < 10，达标后不再 merge）",
      "react_iteration 由首条 ReAct 规则自动初始化为 0（首次执行 call_external 时），无需反应器预置",
      "I/O 结果按类型隔离: __io_results__.{io_type}；消费后以 JSON null 清除（exists 将 null 视为不存在）",
      "v0.3.1: call_external 消费结果时将 tools 持久化到 payload.tools，merge 模板通过 {{tools}} 引用（原指令的 tools 在 call_service 轮已不可达）",
      "v0.3.1: set 的 attr 引用 payload 内以 __ 开头的字段时必须写显式前缀（如 __exec__.payload.__io_results__.call_external），否则会被误判为状态根路径",
      "本版撤销兼容说明: query_db/http_get/save_memory 不再是内置指令类型（v0.3.1 宪法未定义对应 transform 规则，提交会触发显式警告——TCB 层检测到 noop 效果返回 TransitionResult::Ignored，反应器产生 Error 事实）；应用层应用 call_service 实现这些能力，由 governance 层按 service_name 路由",
      "本版 call_external 参数: 仅使用 messages（LLM 消息历史数组）与 tools（可选工具描述）；prompt/system 不再作为指令参数（live handler 可直接从 messages 透传）",
      "语义澄清: 业务 set 指令为纯覆盖语义——宪法规则硬编码元指令 operation=set，指令 params 中的 operation 字段（如 add/sub）被忽略；算术更新必须使用 increment（add）/decrement（sub）指令。误用 set+add 做循环体累加会导致计数器每轮被覆盖回常量、while_loop 条件永真（差分测试回归教训）"
    ]
  },
  "transform": [
    {
      "type": "branch",
      "params": {
        "domain": {
          "type": "instruction",
          "instruction_type": "increment"
        },
        "on_true": [
          {
            "type": "set",
            "params": {
              "attr": "__exec__.instruction.params.attr",
              "operation": "add",
              "value": "__exec__.instruction.params.delta"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "branch",
      "params": {
        "domain": {
          "type": "instruction",
          "instruction_type": "decrement"
        },
        "on_true": [
          {
            "type": "set",
            "params": {
              "attr": "__exec__.instruction.params.attr",
              "operation": "sub",
              "value": "__exec__.instruction.params.delta"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "branch",
      "params": {
        "domain": {
          "type": "instruction",
          "instruction_type": "set"
        },
        "on_true": [
          {
            "type": "set",
            "params": {
              "attr": "__exec__.instruction.params.attr",
              "operation": "set",
              "value": "__exec__.instruction.params.value"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "branch",
      "params": {
        "domain": {
          "type": "instruction",
          "instruction_type": "sequence"
        },
        "on_true": [
          {
            "type": "push",
            "params": {
              "instructions": "__exec__.instruction.params.instructions"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "branch",
      "params": {
        "domain": {
          "type": "instruction",
          "instruction_type": "conditional"
        },
        "on_true": [
          {
            "type": "branch",
            "params": {
              "domain": "__exec__.instruction.params.domain",
              "on_true": [
                {
                  "type": "push",
                  "params": {
                    "instructions": [
                      "__exec__.instruction.params.then"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "on_false": [
                {
                  "type": "push",
                  "params": {
                    "instructions": [
                      "__exec__.instruction.params.else"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "branch",
      "params": {
        "domain": {
          "type": "instruction",
          "instruction_type": "while_loop"
        },
        "on_true": [
          {
            "type": "branch",
            "params": {
              "domain": "__exec__.instruction.params.condition",
              "on_true": [
                {
                  "type": "push",
                  "params": {
                    "instructions": [
                      "__exec__.instruction.params.body",
                      "__exec__.instruction"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "on_false": []
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "branch",
      "params": {
        "domain": {
          "type": "all",
          "inner": [
            { "type": "instruction", "instruction_type": "call_external" },
            {
              "type": "not",
              "inner": {
                "type": "exists",
                "path": "__exec__.payload.react_iteration"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "on_true": [
          {
            "type": "set",
            "params": {
              "attr": "react_iteration",
              "operation": "set",
              "value": 0
            }
          }
        ],
        "on_false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "branch",
      "params": {
        "domain": {
          "type": "instruction",
          "instruction_type": "call_external"
        },
        "on_true": [
          {
            "type": "branch",
            "params": {
              "domain": {
                "type": "exists",
                "path": "__exec__.payload.__io_results__.call_external"
              },
              "on_true": [
                {
                  "type": "set",
                  "params": {
                    "attr": "llm_response",
                    "operation": "set",
                    "value": "__exec__.payload.__io_results__.call_external"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "branch",
                  "params": {
                    "domain": {
                      "type": "exists",
                      "path": "__exec__.instruction.params.tools"
                    },
                    "on_true": [
                      {
                        "type": "set",
                        "params": {
                          "attr": "tools",
                          "operation": "set",
                          "value": "__exec__.instruction.params.tools"
                        }
                      }
                    ],
                    "on_false": []
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "set",
                  "params": {
                    "attr": "__exec__.payload.__io_results__.call_external",
                    "operation": "set",
                    "value": null
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "branch",
                  "params": {
                    "domain": {
                      "type": "has_fields",
                      "path": "__exec__.payload.llm_response",
                      "fields": ["tool_calls"]
                    },
                    "on_true": [
                      {
                        "type": "collect",
                        "params": {
                          "from": "__exec__.payload.llm_response.tool_calls",
                          "each": {
                            "type": "call_service",
                            "params": {
                              "service_name": "{{name}}",
                              "args": "{{args}}"
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    ],
                    "on_false": [
                      {
                        "type": "push",
                        "params": {
                          "instructions": [{ "type": "noop" }]
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "on_false": [
                {
                  "type": "io_request",
                  "params": {
                    "io_type": "call_external",
                    "messages": "__exec__.instruction.params.messages",
                    "tools?": "__exec__.instruction.params.tools"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "branch",
      "params": {
        "domain": {
          "type": "instruction",
          "instruction_type": "call_service"
        },
        "on_true": [
          {
            "type": "branch",
            "params": {
              "domain": {
                "type": "exists",
                "path": "__exec__.payload.__io_results__.call_service"
              },
              "on_true": [
                {
                  "type": "set",
                  "params": {
                    "attr": "service_result",
                    "operation": "set",
                    "value": "__exec__.payload.__io_results__.call_service"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "set",
                  "params": {
                    "attr": "__exec__.payload.__io_results__.call_service",
                    "operation": "set",
                    "value": null
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "branch",
                  "params": {
                    "domain": {
                      "type": "lt",
                      "path": "__exec__.payload.react_iteration",
                      "value": 10
                    },
                    "on_true": [
                      {
                        "type": "set",
                        "params": {
                          "attr": "react_iteration",
                          "operation": "add",
                          "value": 1
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "merge",
                        "params": {
                          "messages": "__exec__.payload.llm_response.messages",
                          "tool_result": "__exec__.payload.service_result",
                          "next_instruction": {
                            "type": "call_external",
                            "params": {
                              "messages": "{{messages}}",
                              "tools": "{{tools}}"
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    ],
                    "on_false": [
                      {
                        "type": "push",
                        "params": {
                          "instructions": [{ "type": "noop" }]
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "on_false": [
                {
                  "type": "io_request",
                  "params": {
                    "io_type": "call_service",
                    "service_name": "__exec__.instruction.params.service_name",
                    "args?": "__exec__.instruction.params.args"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "branch",
      "params": {
        "domain": { "type": "instruction", "instruction_type": "noop" },
        "on_true": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "branch",
      "params": {
        "domain": { "type": "all", "inner": [] },
        "on_true": []
      }
    }
  ]
}
